#: ../../reference/packages.rst:79
msgid "Installing packages with ``mpremote``"
msgstr "``mpremote`` でパッケージをインストールする"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:81
msgid ""
"The :term:`mpremote` tool also includes the same functionality as ``mip`` "
